    <briefdescription>
<para>List model of the legend entries of a list of series. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Has one row per series in <computeroutput>series</computeroutput> that is visible and returns a <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries_1a4e5a53df93bf478ae4b3f2f53ee4ff37" kindref="member">PlotSeries::legendEntry()</ref></computeroutput>. Series without an entry, such as <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1HeatmapSeries" kindref="compound">HeatmapSeries</ref></computeroutput>, and hidden series have no row. Rows follow changes of the series&apos; entries, names, and visibility.</para>
<para>Roles: <computeroutput>series</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>name</computeroutput> (the series&apos; <computeroutput>name</computeroutput>, its <computeroutput>objectName</computeroutput>, or &quot;Series N&quot;), and <computeroutput>entry</computeroutput> (a <computeroutput><ref refid="structQAccelPlot_1_1LegendEntry" kindref="compound">LegendEntry</ref></computeroutput>). <computeroutput>Plot</computeroutput> provides one over all its series as <computeroutput>legendModel:</computeroutput> </para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">QAccelPlot.Plot<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>id:<sp/>plot</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>legend:<sp/>QAccelPlot.Legend<sp/>{<sp/>model:<sp/>QAccelPlot.LegendModel<sp/>{<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LegendModel_1acc7b9e6be048dc77d8a0b66c2eacc39a" kindref="member">series</ref>:<sp/>[signal,<sp/>fit]<sp/>}<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structQAccelPlot_1_1LegendEntry" kindref="compound">LegendEntry</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries_1a4e5a53df93bf478ae4b3f2f53ee4ff37" kindref="member">PlotSeries::legendEntry()</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
